header class="mb-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-3"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-fg-faint"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a class="text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-fg" href="/docs/bundler" data-link="" data-prefetch="true">Bundler</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-faint/70">›</span><span class="text-accent-strong">Development Server</span></li></ol></nav><div class="relative inline-flex text-[13px] -mt-1 hidden shrink-0 sm:inline-flex"><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-2 border border-line px-2.5 text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:z-10 hover:border-rule hover:text-fg"><span class="t-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"/><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"/></svg></span>Copy page</button><button type="button" aria-label="More page actions" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" class="-ml-px inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center border border-line text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:z-10 hover:border-rule hover:text-fg"><span class="t-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span></button></div></div><h1 class="display text-balance text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-fg">Fullstack dev server</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-[64ch] text-pretty text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Build fullstack applications with Bun&#x27;s integrated dev server that bundles frontend assets and handles API routes</p></header><div class="DocSearch-content docs-prose prose w-full max-w-none" style="--tw-prose-body:rgb(var(--c-fg) / 0.88);--tw-prose-headings:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-lead:rgb(var(--c-fg-muted));--tw-prose-links:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-bold:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-counters:rgb(var(--c-fg-faint));--tw-prose-bullets:rgb(var(--c-line-strong));--tw-prose-hr:rgb(var(--c-line));--tw-prose-quotes:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-quote-borders:rgb(var(--c-line-strong));--tw-prose-captions:rgb(var(--c-fg-faint));--tw-prose-kbd:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-kbd-shadows:var(--c-fg);--tw-prose-code:rgb(var(--c-fg));--tw-prose-pre-code:rgb(var(--c-code-fg));--tw-prose-pre-bg:rgb(var(--c-code-bg));--tw-prose-th-borders:rgb(var(--c-line-strong));--tw-prose-td-borders:rgb(var(--c-line))"><p>To get started, import HTML files and pass them to the <code>routes</code> option in <code>Bun.serve()</code>.</p><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="ts"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 3h14l4 4v14H3z"/><path d="M6.5 10.5h5M9 10.5V18"/><path d="M18 10.5h-3l-1 1v2l1 1h2l1 1v1.5l-1 1h-3"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">app.ts</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09]"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="0"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">import</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> { serve, sql } </span><span class="s-ff79c6">from</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">bun</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">import</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> dashboard </span><span class="s-ff79c6">from</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./dashboard.html</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">import</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> homepage </span><span class="s-ff79c6">from</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./index.html</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> server </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">serve</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">({</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  routes</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// ** HTML imports **</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// Bundle &amp; route index.html to &quot;/&quot;. This uses HTMLRewriter to scan</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// the HTML for `&lt;script&gt;` and `&lt;link&gt;` tags, runs Bun&#39;s JavaScript</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// &amp; CSS bundler on them, transpiles any TypeScript, JSX, and TSX,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// downlevels CSS with Bun&#39;s CSS parser and serves the result.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> homepage,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// Bundle &amp; route dashboard.html to &quot;/dashboard&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/dashboard</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> dashboard,</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// ** API endpoints ** (Bun v1.2.3+ required)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/api/users</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      </span><span class="s-ff79c6">async</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">GET</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(</span><span class="s-ffb86c s-i">req</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">) {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">        </span><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> users </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">await</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">sql</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`SELECT * FROM users`</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">        </span><span class="s-ff79c6">return</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> Response.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">json</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(users);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      </span><span class="s-ff79c6">async</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">POST</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(</span><span class="s-ffb86c s-i">req</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">) {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">        </span><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> { name, email } </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">await</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> req.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">json</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">();</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">        </span><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> [user] </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">await</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">sql</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (</span><span class="s-ff79c6">${</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">name</span><span class="s-ff79c6">}</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">, </span><span class="s-ff79c6">${</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">email</span><span class="s-ff79c6">}</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">) RETURNING *`</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">        </span><span class="s-ff79c6">return</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> Response.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">json</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(user);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/api/users/:id</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">async</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ffb86c s-i">req</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=&gt;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      </span><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> { id } </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> req.params;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      </span><span class="s-ff79c6">const</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> [user] </span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-ff79c6">await</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b">sql</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = </span><span class="s-ff79c6">${</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">id</span><span class="s-ff79c6">}</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">      </span><span class="s-ff79c6">return</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> Response.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">json</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(user);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  </span><span class="s-6272a4">// Enable development mode for:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  </span><span class="s-6272a4">// - Detailed error messages</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  </span><span class="s-6272a4">// - Hot reloading (Bun v1.2.3+ required)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  development</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-bd93f9">true</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">});</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">console.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">log</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`Listening on </span><span class="s-ff79c6">${</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">server.url</span><span class="s-ff79c6">}</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">`</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">);</span></span></code></pre></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="CopyIcon group/copy inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg-faint transition-[color,background,opacity] hover:bg-fg/[0.06] hover:text-fg h-7 w-7 copy absolute right-1.5 top-[-3px]"><span class="relative block h-4 w-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 opacity-100"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"></path><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 text-success transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="bash"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 4h14l4 4v12H3z"/><path d="M7 10l3 3-3 3"/><path d="M12.5 16H17"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">terminal</span></div><div class="relative" style="--doc-prompt:&quot;$ &quot;"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09] [&amp;_.line:not(:empty):has(span)]:before:content-[var(--doc-prompt)] [&amp;_.line]:before:select-none [&amp;_.line]:before:text-fg-faint [&amp;_.line:has(&gt;.s-6272a4:first-child)]:before:content-none"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="1"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">bun run app.ts</span></span></code></pre></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="CopyIcon group/copy inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg-faint transition-[color,background,opacity] hover:bg-fg/[0.06] hover:text-fg h-7 w-7 copy absolute right-1.5 top-[-3px]"><span class="relative block h-4 w-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 opacity-100"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"></path><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 text-success transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><h2 id="html-routes" class="anchored">HTML Routes<a href="#html-routes" aria-label="Permalink" data-pagefind-ignore="" class="anchor">#</a></h2><h3 id="html-imports-as-routes" class="anchored">HTML Imports as Routes<a href="#html-imports-as-routes" aria-label="Permalink" data-pagefind-ignore="" class="anchor">#</a></h3><p>To specify entrypoints to your frontend, import HTML files into your JavaScript/TypeScript/TSX/JSX files.</p><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="ts"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 3h14l4 4v14H3z"/><path d="M6.5 10.5h5M9 10.5V18"/><path d="M18 10.5h-3l-1 1v2l1 1h2l1 1v1.5l-1 1h-3"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">app.ts</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09]"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="2"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">import</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> dashboard </span><span class="s-ff79c6">from</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./dashboard.html</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-ff79c6">import</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> homepage </span><span class="s-ff79c6">from</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./index.html</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="CopyIcon group/copy inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg-faint transition-[color,background,opacity] hover:bg-fg/[0.06] hover:text-fg h-7 w-7 copy absolute right-1.5 top-[-3px]"><span class="relative block h-4 w-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 opacity-100"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"></path><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 text-success transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><p>Pass the imported HTML files as routes to <code>Bun.serve()</code>.</p><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="ts"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 3h14l4 4v14H3z"/><path d="M6.5 10.5h5M9 10.5V18"/><path d="M18 10.5h-3l-1 1v2l1 1h2l1 1v1.5l-1 1h-3"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">app.ts</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09]"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="3"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">Bun.</span><span class="s-50fa7b">serve</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">({</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  routes</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> homepage,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/dashboard</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">:</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> dashboard,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  </span><span class="s-50fa7b">fetch</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">(</span><span class="s-ffb86c s-i">req</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">) {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    </span><span class="s-6272a4">// ... api requests</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">});</span></span></code></pre></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="CopyIcon group/copy inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg-faint transition-[color,background,opacity] hover:bg-fg/[0.06] hover:text-fg h-7 w-7 copy absolute right-1.5 top-[-3px]"><span class="relative block h-4 w-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 opacity-100"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"></path><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 text-success transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><p>When you make a request to <code>/dashboard</code> or <code>/</code>, Bun automatically bundles the <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> tags in the HTML files, exposes them as static routes, and serves the result.</p><h3 id="html-processing-example" class="anchored">HTML Processing Example<a href="#html-processing-example" aria-label="Permalink" data-pagefind-ignore="" class="anchor">#</a></h3><p>An <code>index.html</code> file like this:</p><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="html"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 3h14l4 4v14H3z"/><path d="M10 11l-3 3 3 3"/><path d="M14 11l3 3-3 3"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">index.html</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09]"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="4"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">&lt;!</span><span class="s-ff79c6">DOCTYPE</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">html</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">&lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">html</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">head</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">title</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;Home&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">title</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">link</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">rel</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">stylesheet</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">href</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./reset.css</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> /&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">link</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">rel</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">stylesheet</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">href</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./styles.css</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> /&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  &lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">head</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">body</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">div</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">id</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">root</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">div</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">script</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">type</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">module</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">src</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./sentry-and-preloads.ts</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">script</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">script</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">type</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">module</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">src</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">./my-app.tsx</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">script</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  &lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">body</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">html</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="CopyIcon group/copy inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg-faint transition-[color,background,opacity] hover:bg-fg/[0.06] hover:text-fg h-7 w-7 copy absolute right-1.5 top-[-3px]"><span class="relative block h-4 w-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 opacity-100"><path d="M5.5 16H3V3h13v2.5"></path><path d="M8 8h9l4 4v9H8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-4 w-4 text-success transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><p>Becomes something like this:</p><div class="DocFence group/fence relative my-5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-code-bg text-code-fg [&amp;:has(+.DocFence-output)]:rounded-b-none" data-lang="html"><div class="DocFenceHeader flex min-h-[34px] items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-subtle/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-none text-fg-muted"><span class="doc-icon inline-flex shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-full [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-full h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d="M3 3h14l4 4v14H3z"/><path d="M10 11l-3 3 3 3"/><path d="M14 11l3 3-3 3"/></svg></span><span class="truncate" translate="no">index.html</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlock group/code !my-0 !rounded-none !border-0 [&amp;_pre]:!overflow-x-visible [&amp;_.line-hl]:inline-block [&amp;_.line-hl]:min-w-[calc(100%+4.1rem)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:-ml-[1.1rem] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pl-[calc(1.1rem-3px)] [&amp;_.line-hl]:pr-12 [&amp;_.line-hl]:align-top [&amp;_.line-hl]:h-5 [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-l-[3px] [&amp;_.line-hl]:border-accent [&amp;_.line-hl]:bg-accent/[0.09]"><div class="relative"><div class="CodeBlockScroll"><div data-h="5"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">&lt;!</span><span class="s-ff79c6">DOCTYPE</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">html</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">&lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">html</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">  &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">head</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">title</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;Home&lt;/</span><span class="s-ff79c6">title</span><span class="s-f8f8f2">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="s-f8f8f2">    &lt;</span><span class="s-ff79c6">link</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">rel</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">stylesheet</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> </span><span class="s-50fa7b s-i">href</span><span class="s-ff79c6">=</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f1fa8c">/index-[hash].css</span><span class="s-e9f284">&quot;</span><span class="s-f8f8f2"> /&gt;</span></span>
